<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px 0; text-align: left; }
  .header-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .section-title { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .grid-container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .grid-item { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; }
  .line-item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
  .line-item-table th, .line-item-table td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  .footer-section { margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <div>
      <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Gettysburg</span>
      <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">COLLEGE</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Campus Print Shop</p>
      <p>Campus Box <span data-field="campus_box_number">{{ campus_box_number }}</span> • Phone (<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>) <span data-field="phone_number_2">{{ phone_number_2 }}</span></p>
      <p>Job # <span data-field="job_number">{{ job_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Date Requested: <span data-field="date_requested">{{ date_requested }}</span></p>
      <p>Date Needed: <span data-field="date_needed">{{ date_needed }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">Printing Services Request Form</h1>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Department: <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Service Requested by (Your Name): <span data-field="requester_name">{{ requester_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Charge To #: <span data-field="charge_to_number">{{ charge_to_number }}</span></p>
    <p>Campus Box: <span data-field="campus_box">{{ campus_box }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">The billing number provided is the number that will be charged with no exceptions.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Job Description</div>

  <div class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p><strong>DUPLICATING</strong></p>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td># of copies</td>
          <td><span data-field="duplication.copies">{{ duplication.copies }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>B/W</td>
          <td><span data-field="duplication.bw">{{ duplication.bw }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Color</td>
          <td><span data-field="duplication.color">{{ duplication.color }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Proof Request</td>
          <td><span data-field="duplication.proof_request">{{ duplication.proof_request }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>As Is</td>
          <td><span data-field="duplication.as_is">{{ duplication.as_is }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-item">
      <p><strong>BINDING</strong></p>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td>Single Sided</td>
          <td><span data-field="binding.single_sided">{{ binding.single_sided }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Back to Back</td>
          <td><span data-field="binding.back_to_back">{{ binding.back_to_back }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Paper - Size</td>
          <td><span data-field="binding.paper_size">{{ binding.paper_size }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Paper - Weight</td>
          <td><span data-field="binding.paper_weight">{{ binding.paper_weight }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Special Paper</td>
          <td><span data-field="binding.special_paper">{{ binding.special_paper }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-item">
      <p><strong>MAILING</strong></p>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td>Collate</td>
          <td><span data-field="mailing.collate">{{ mailing.collate }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Collate & Staple</td>
          <td><span data-field="mailing.collate_staple">{{ mailing.collate_staple }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Staple</td>
          <td><span data-field="mailing.staple">{{ mailing.staple }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Booklet</td>
          <td><span data-field="mailing.booklet">{{ mailing.booklet }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td></td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-item">
      <p><strong>OTHER</strong></p>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td>Graphic Design</td>
          <td><span data-field="other.graphic_design">{{ other.graphic_design }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Business Cards</td>
          <td><span data-field="other.business_cards">{{ other.business_cards }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Letterhead</td>
          <td><span data-field="other.letterhead">{{ other.letterhead }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="delivery.deliver_to">{{ delivery.deliver_to }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Env.</td>
          <td><span data-field="other.envelope">{{ other.envelope }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="delivery.via_campus_mail">{{ delivery.via_campus_mail }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">FINISHING</div>
  <div class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Cut/Trim</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.cut_trim">{{ finishing.cut_trim }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Pad</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.pad">{{ finishing.pad }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Perf. Score</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.perf_score">{{ finishing.perf_score }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Deliver to</p>
      <p><span data-field="delivery.deliver_to_field">{{ delivery.deliver_to_field }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Fold</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.fold">{{ finishing.fold }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Drill</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.drill">{{ finishing.drill }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Via Campus Mail</p>
      <p><span data-field="delivery.via_campus_mail_field">{{ delivery.via_campus_mail_field }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Pick Up (Call or email when ready)</p>
      <p><span data-field="delivery.pickup_option">{{ delivery.pickup_option }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Hole Punch</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.hole_punch">{{ finishing.hole_punch }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Poster Mounting</p>
      <p><span data-field="finishing.poster_mounting">{{ finishing.poster_mounting }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <p>Email:</p>
      <p><span data-field="delivery.email_address">{{ delivery.email_address }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-item">
      <!-- Empty placeholder for layout balance -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:</div>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #000; min-height: 100px; padding: 10px;">
    <span data-field="special_instructions_text">{{ special_instructions_text }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">PLEASE READ • WARNING CONCERNING COPYRIGHT RESTRICTIONS</div>
  <div style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.4;">
    <p>The copyright law of the United States (Title 17, United States Code) governs the making of photocopies or other reproduction of copyrighted material. Under certain conditions specified in the law, libraries and archives are authorized to furnish a photocopy or other reproduction. One of these specified conditions is that the photocopy or reproduction is not to be "used for any purpose other than private study, scholarship or research." If a user makes a request for, or later uses, a photocopy or reproduction for purposes in excess of "fair use," that user may be liable for copyright infringement.</p>
    <p>This institution reserves the right to refuse to accept a copying order if, in its judgment, fulfillment of the order would involve violation of copyright law.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <table class="line-item-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Quantity</th>
          <th style="width: 50%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">#</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Rate</th>
          <th style="width: 10%;">Total</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in line_items %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].quantity">{{ item.quantity }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].unit_price">{{ item.unit_price }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].rate">{{ item.rate }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].total">{{ item.total }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-section" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div>
      Waste Count: <span data-field="waste_count">{{ waste_count }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Date Completed: <span data-field="date_completed">{{ date_completed }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Run by: <span data-field="run_by">{{ run_by }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Total Charges $: <span data-field="total_charges">{{ total_charges }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>